    <briefdescription>
<para>Parser for German legal text structure. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Recognises:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>§-paragraphs (§ N, §§ N-M)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Teil / Abschnitt / Kapitel / Unterabschnitt headings</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Absatz numbering within paragraphs: (1), (2), …</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Implements a single-pass regex-based parser; no external dependencies. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
